                "text": "No restart icon on the main screen's Restarting view (owner, 2026-11-02, #1543): the headline and its sub lines carry it. The sub lines are the saved session with its time and, when a staged update installs during the restart, \"Installing Segno <version>\". The 7\" readout keeps the restart icon with \"Restarting\", and shows no Segno logo."
